700 PRINT"              1. AIRXAF RX01/2 FUNCT TEST"
710 PRINT"              2. AIRXBG RX01/2 PERF EXER"
720 PRINT"              3. DILACB LA180 TEST"
730 PRINT"              4. AHLQAE LQP8 TEST"
